WEBVTT

06:34.295 --> 06:37.340
Bread. And two of those little fish.

06:37.465 --> 06:40.718
And a mug of dark beer
to wash it down.

06:43.429 --> 06:45.431
And bacon, burnt black.

06:45.556 --> 06:47.433
- Hyah.
- (LAUGHS)

06:47.558 --> 06:50.395
- Little brother.
- Beloved siblings.

06:54.857 --> 06:56.734
Is Bran going to die?

06:58.653 --> 06:59.737
Apparently not.
